                <pb facs="0453" n="337" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg337"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838:00/815.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 7, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Oreste Zamor has just entered Port au Prince with about 4000 men without disorder
                    and has occupied the most important Government offices.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
